WEBVTT

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.670
So this is where they stamp you? We want one. Deploy more agents.

00:00:12.506 --> 00:00:15.008
Odd. Every stamp makes two more. I'm sure that reasons out fine.

00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:26.680
None of them ever leave our tent. There's no release here to inspect.

